--| Implication in terms of biconditional and conjunction. Theorem *4.71 of [WhiteheadRussell] p. 120. (Contributed by NM, 21-Jun-1993.) (Proof shortened by Wolf Lammen, 2-Dec-2012.)
(pub theorem pm4_71 ((ph wff ()) (ps wff ()))
