    (biantru ((wi (wa ph ps) ph) (wi ph (wa ph ps)))
      (simpl (ph ps)))
    (anclb (ph ps))
    (dfbi2 (ph (wa ph ps)))))

--| Implication in terms of biconditional and conjunction. Theorem *4.71 of [WhiteheadRussell] p. 120 (with conjunct reversed). (Contributed by NM, 25-Jul-1999.)
