--| Two ways to express exclusive disjunction ( ~ df-xor ). Theorem *5.22 of [WhiteheadRussell] p. 124. (Contributed by NM, 3-Jan-2005.) (Proof shortened by Wolf Lammen, 22-Jan-2013.)
(pub theorem xor ((ph wff ()) (ps wff ()))
  ()
  (wb (wn (wb ph ps)) (wo (wa ph (wn ps)) (wa ps (wn ph))))
