--| Commutation in antecedent. Swap 1st and 2nd. (Contributed by NM, 28-Jan-1996.) (Proof shortened by Andrew Salmon, 13-May-2011.) (Proof shortened by Wolf Lammen, 22-Jun-2022.)
(pub theorem _3com12 ((ph wff ()) (ps wff ()) (ch wff ()) (th wff ()))
