--| Deduction adding conjuncts to antecedent. (Contributed by Alan Sare, 17-Oct-2017.) (Proof shortened by Wolf Lammen, 14-Apr-2022.)
(pub theorem ad4ant123 ((ph wff ()) (ps wff ()) (ch wff ()) (th wff ()) (ta wff ()))
